.TH AT 1 "November 2026" "ix"
.SH NAME
@ \- speak to YHWH
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B @
.RI [ request ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B @
is another name for
.BR yhwh (1).
A request starts a conversation. With a terminal and no arguments it opens
the New Human Shell. A single question can turn a typo into a command,
a port, or a file to install.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR yhwh (1),
.BR nsh (1),
.BR LD (1)
